1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,920
NASA captured a sound fifty-seven octaves below middle C.

2
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:07,150
It is the deepest note in the entire known universe.

3
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:12,250
Two hundred forty million light-years away sits the Perseus Cluster.

4
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:16,520
Its supermassive black hole blasts energy into surrounding hot gas.

5
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:21,020
Scientists say sound cannot travel through space. So how is this possible?

6
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:25,240
The cluster gas is so dense it carries actual pressure waves.

7
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:30,550
NASA rescaled the frequency fifty-seven octaves so humans could hear it.

8
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:35,340
That single acoustic note has been singing continuously for two billion years.

9
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:38,790
Which means in the absolute silence of deep space...
